# Cloud auto-merge

When running as a Cloud Agent, enable auto-merge on the PR you opened once the
work is finished, so it merges on its own after checks pass.

A PR is finished when:

- every requested change is implemented and validated;
- `cargo build --locked --all-targets`, `cargo test`, and `cargo clippy` pass;
- the PR is marked ready for review (not draft) and CI is green or expected to go green.

Then run:

```sh
gh pr merge --auto --squash <pr-number>
```

Use squash so `main` keeps one commit per PR. Do not auto-merge while work is
incomplete, tests fail, the PR is still a draft, or the user asked to hold it.
